\">AI and Dictation</span></span><h1 class=\"ai-step__title_10bcc typography__title_92c9a\">AI that works <br> with your OS</h1></div><p class=\"ai-step__subtitle_9d3ff typography__subtitle_bbf06 text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-16_9d60a text__weight-400_36886 text__color-tertiary_8f805 text__align-left_43d84\">Ask anything or tell Bayrust what to do. With deep integration across your operating system and apps, you truly get things done.</p><div class=\"ai-step__privacy_941f4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ai-step__privacyButton_edc2b text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-16_9d60a text__weight-400_36886 text__color-secondary_76316 text__align-left_43d84\"><svg class=\"icon__root_c1ca7\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><use href=\"/ds/sprite/shield-03.svg#s\"></use></svg>AI Privacy &amp; Security</button><div class=\"ai-step__privacyTooltip_cc92d radius__radius-12_b9a31\"><p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-primary_37304 text__align-left_43d84\">Bayrust AI gives you powerful capabilities, but always on your terms:</p><ul class=\"ai-step__privacyTooltipList_73911\"><li class=\"ai-step__privacyTooltipListItem_73716\"><svg class=\"icon__root_c1ca7 ai-step__privacyTooltipIcon_317b4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"/ds/sprite/minus-circle-filled.svg#s\"></use></svg><div><p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-primary_37304 text__align-left_43d84\">Full control</p><p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-secondary_76316 text__align-left_43d84\">AI only runs when you explicitly trigger it</p></div></li><li class=\"ai-step__privacyTooltipListItem_73716\"><svg class=\"icon__root_c1ca7 ai-step__privacyTooltipIcon_317b4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"/ds/sprite/lock.svg#s\"></use></svg><div><p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-primary_37304 text__align-left_43d84\">No data collection</p><p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-secondary_76316 text__align-left_43d84\">AI is never trained on your data, and your prompts are never stored.</p></div></li><li class=\"ai-step__privacyTooltipListItem_73716\"><svg class=\"icon__root_c1ca7 ai-step__privacyTooltipIcon_317b4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"/ds/sprite/shield-01.svg#s\"></use></svg><div><p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-primary_37304 text__align-left_43d84\">Encrypted &amp; Secure</p><p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-secondary_76316 text__align-left_43d84\">All requests are safely transmitted via verified partners.</p></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"ai-step__grid_fb9a7\"><div class=\"feature-card__card_e3664 radius__radius-12_b9a31\"><div class=\"feature-card__cardPlayIcon_46d60\"><svg class=\"icon__root_c1ca7\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><use href=\"/ds/sprite/play-filled.svg#s\"></use></svg></div><div class=\"feature-card__cardPlayIcon_46d60\"><span class=\"spinner__root_3191c\"><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span><span class=\"spinner__leaf_1ccc4 radius__radius-6_ff8c8\"></span></span></div><div class=\"feature-card__cardContent_69ff4 feature-card__visible_91d9a\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"feature-card__cardImage_9bfa1\" src=\"/ds/asset